                    "name": "explanationText",
                    "content": {
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "locale": "en",
                          "text": "This model demonstates the responsive layout feature of the Control Grid and the Multi Column Section.\n<br/>\nFor different horizontal space situations (large, medium, small, extra small) different grid layouts can be shown. For large, medium and small these layouts have the same number of columns but the column widths can be modeled per layout. The extra small layout has always one column using the full width.\n<br/>\nOffset and span can be configured per layout for the Control Grid Cells."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
